## Article 8. Appeals not subject to review and resolution

```catala
declaration scope Article8NonReviewableAppeals:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input appealForm content AppealForm
  input appealType content AppealType
  input isAnonymous content YesNo
  input isRepeatedAppeal content YesNo
  input firstAppealResolvedOnMerits content YesNo
  input reviewPeriodExpired content YesNo
  input applicantDeclaredIncapacitated content YesNo
  input isCollectiveAppeal content YesNo
  output isAnonymousNotReviewable content YesNo
  output isRepeatedNotReviewable content YesNo
  output isExpiredNotReviewable content YesNo
  output isIncapacitatedNotReviewable content YesNo
  output isNotReviewable content YesNo
  output terminationDecisionRequired content YesNo

scope Article8NonReviewableAppeals:
  label anonymous_not_reviewable exception default_anonymous
  definition isAnonymousNotReviewable under condition
    appealForm = Written and isAnonymous = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_anonymous definition isAnonymousNotReviewable equals No

  label repeated_not_reviewable exception default_repeated
  definition isRepeatedNotReviewable under condition
    isRepeatedAppeal = Yes and firstAppealResolvedOnMerits = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_repeated definition isRepeatedNotReviewable equals No

  label expired_not_reviewable exception default_expired
  definition isExpiredNotReviewable under condition
    reviewPeriodExpired = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_expired definition isExpiredNotReviewable equals No

  label incapacitated_not_reviewable exception default_incapacitated
  definition isIncapacitatedNotReviewable under condition
    applicantDeclaredIncapacitated = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_incapacitated definition isIncapacitatedNotReviewable equals No

  label not_reviewable_exception
    exception default_reviewable

  definition isNotReviewable under condition
    isAnonymousNotReviewable = Yes
    or isRepeatedNotReviewable = Yes
    or isExpiredNotReviewable = Yes
    or isIncapacitatedNotReviewable = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_reviewable definition isNotReviewable equals No

  label termination_required_exception
    exception default_termination

  definition terminationDecisionRequired under condition
    isNotReviewable = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_termination definition terminationDecisionRequired equals No
```